  atoms   the atoms pack
  shells  the shell pack
  prims   the primitive pack

md1_t  @55347cf9
  what  The kinetic energy matrix T over Cartesian basis functions, as a member of the integrals stage.
  atoms   the atoms pack
  shells  the shell pack
  prims   the primitive pack

md1_v  @d61aeb74
  what  The nuclear attraction matrix V over Cartesian basis functions, as a member of the integrals stage.
  atoms   the atoms pack
  shells  the shell pack
  prims   the primitive pack

md1_h  @e2d9d447
  why   Used by this module's test that checks the members against each
        other; the SCF builds H itself from the T and V members.
  atoms   the atoms pack
  shells  the shell pack
  prims   the primitive pack
  M       all three matrices

